<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet to meet at 1430 GMT Friday.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet to meet at 1430 GMT Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The cabinet of Prime Minister Romano Prodi will meet at 1430 GMT on Friday, Prodi's office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The government said discussions would include laws regarding foreign trade, health, money laundering and new regulations for the gold market. --Rome newsroom +396-678-2501</p>
